{
    "title": "Spider Solitaire",
    "description": "Spider Solitaire is a popular worldwide card game! Everyone can play for FREE!\r\nIf you want to relive the classics, then try this brand new Spider Solitaire, it could show you much more fun, beautiful and friendly experience.\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019d like to relax during your break, don't miss Spider Solitaire!\r\nIf you\u2019d like to train your brain and make your mind more flexible, don't miss Spider Solitaire!\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2665 Smooth Operation: Optimized for mobile devices, bringing the wonderful operating experience on mobiles and tablets\r\n\u2665 Beautiful HD Graphics: High-definition and exquisite graphics performance, large and clear card design\r\n\r\n\u2660 Auto-save: Continue the game anytime, anywhere\r\n\u2660 Unlimited Hints and Undo Options: Intelligent step HINTS and UNDOS can be used for FREE unlimited times\r\n\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Multiple Difficulty: 1, 2 or 4 suit varieties to choose, relax yourself or challenge a higher difficulty\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Winnable Deals: Each game has at least one solution\r\n\r\n\u2663 Daily Challenge: Take on puzzles every day and win trophies\r\n\u2663 Theme Collection: Hundreds of themes, find your own style freely\r\n\r\nIf you like Classic Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire and other card games, or other puzzle games, you must not miss this Spider Solitaire game!\r\n\r\nIf you like it, do not hesitate to share with your friends!",
